# signpost: a trail junction's sign (BUILD_PLAN S5 brief B5): a bark (10)
# post two pixels wide with a paper-cream (5) plate pointing the way, its
# lettering one bark line that spells nothing (two dark dots would read as
# eyes), and an ink (0) line of shadow where the post meets the ground. The
# anchor, 0,0, is the post's foot. 9 wide, 14 tall.
C 5  L -3,-13 2,-13  L -3,-12 3,-12  L 4,-12  L -3,-11 2,-11
C 10  L -2,-12 2,-12
C 10  L 0,-10 0,-1  L 1,-10 1,-1
C 0  L -1,0 2,0
